To learn how to recover deleted messages from Facebook 2019, we have to follow these steps very carefully to achieve it:
We will select the configuration symbol in the upper left part of your screen, we will click and we will choose the saved conversations that are shown.
We will open the Facebook Messenger application on your mobile device, and if you do not have your session open you will have to do so.
When we find the conversation, we will enter it to be able to look at it and if we want to retrieve it in our inbox, we will simply send a message to the person so that it appears on the screen again.
Backup to Facebook In order to create a backup copy of our conversations on Facebook, it is important to have an emergency backup of our messages, being a good option to avoid losing important information from our messages since at some point we may need it.
We will log in to our computer, if we do not have it open.
We will observe that on the left side of the screen, an option appears that says "Your Facebook information". We will click there.
Then all the options that we can support will appear, but in this case we will click on messages, which is what we are talking about in this article.
When the backup file is ready, we will be notified via email and by notification on our account.
Then we will click on download the backup.
