In order to achieve a good display effect of jewelry, most jewelry stores choose to customize the jewelry display cabinets , so what factors need to be considered when customizing the display cabinets? What do you need to pay attention to?
Different jewelry may belong to different styles, some jewelry belong to modern style, and some jewelry belong to classical style, so when customizing jewelry display cabinets, we must first understand the style of jewelry. To see which style of jewelry to customize the display case, and then design a display case consistent with the jewelry style, so that the exhibition cabinet can be coordinated with the environment, so that the jewelry can achieve a good display effect.
When customizing jewelry display cabinets, we should also consider the suitability of materials, not only bearing capacity, but also aesthetics. When customizing, we must not be greedy for small bargains and choose inferior materials.
when choosing materials, some jewelry should choose materials with strong aesthetics, and some jewelry are suitable for using some durable materials. therefore, when customizing jewelry display cabinets, we must choose suitable materials according to the type of jewelry.
To design a perfect appearance If the jewelry display cabinet is designed reasonably, it can make the jewelry look higher grade, so when customizing the jewelry display case, we must design the perfect appearance of the display case, so that the display case can be perfectly integrated with the jewelry, so that the jewelry can have good sales.
Two points should be paid attention to in lighting jewelry display cabinet:
"Enough" does not mean that the brighter the better. Some jewels, such as gold, platinum, pearls, etc., are small in size, so they are required to have enough high illumination, 2000 LX is OK; and some jewels, such as jadeite, crystal, etc., pay attention to softness, so the illumination need not be too high.
Attention should be paid to the collocation of light and color. For example, gold ornaments can be illuminated by cold light cups, while silver or gemstone products can be illuminated by sunlight cups.
On the contrary, if the large cultural relics are placed in the low display cabinet with small space, the display will be too compact and there will be security risks. Therefore, the design of appropriate size display cabinet for cultural relics can not only make rational use of the space of display cabinet, but also reduce some security risks in the display process.
Usually, museums will classify them and display the same type of cultural relics in the same exhibition hall. In order to highlight the exhibition theme, the museum will design the decoration, lighting and tone of the exhibition hall according to different types of cultural relics, so as to match the style of the exhibition hall with the characteristics of cultural relics.
For museums with rich cultural relics resources, static display is a direct and effective way of display, which allows the audience to watch the original appearance of cultural relics and feel the historical background of cultural relics. Dynamic display refers to the organic combination of high technology (such as multimedia technology) and cultural relics display.
