We can find some differences between Lusitanian horses depending on the bloodline from which they descend:
The horses from the Andrade branch are taller, with slightly straight head, strong and rounded croup, which gives it a elegant bearing. They are very good for dressage, rejoneo and field work.
On the other hand, the descendants of the Vegia branch, who are also excellent in the rejoneo, they have the convex head typical of the breed, held by a flexible neck. They are shorter in size than the Andrades.
However, it would not be until the arrival of Juan V of Portugal and decision to create a cavalry of Portuguese equines, when the race of the Lusitano horse would finish taking shape. It was then that breeding started of the Portuguese horse.
With these horses, and following the wish of the monarch Juan V of Portugal and his son to obtain saddle horses of exceptional quality, continued selection of specimens by Alter Real. This selection and crossing of equines continued until achieving the creation of the two bloodlines that would give rise to the Lusitano horse: Andrade and Vegia.
Perhaps that is why many of us are accompanied by horses while we sleep. But why?
1 What does it mean to me to dream about horses?
What does it mean to me to dream about horses?
Surely something similar happens to you. The feeling of wanting freedom is very natural in humans, and it is much more intense when you are living your life in an area that you do not really like.
Dreaming of horses always leaves you with a very pleasant feeling of peace and calm. It is the healthiest sweet that your imagination can give you to start the day with peace and joy.
If we see several horses trotting little by little it means that we are achieving the goals we had in mind. But be careful, because it could also be that a close friend is having a hard time.
If we see calm horses, it means that calm times come, without problems. Good times to make important decisions, for example
If we see a sick horse or that has suffered an accident, it means that times are coming a bit difficult. We will have no choice but to be patient.
If in our dream we see a dead horse or that we kill one, it means that there is something very important in our life that we have not solved and that we need to solve. It may also be that we hurt our loved ones for being selfish.
If we dream that we are riding (or trying) a wild horse that is nervous, it means that we are letting ourselves be carried away by passion.
White, unlike black, is a color that has positive things associated with it: purity, prosperity and good luck. If we see it in our dream, it means that we will have good luck in business and in life.
Have you ever dreamed of one horse or several?
I hope this article has been, at least, curious .
