The dwarf horse is a species of horse that It has been created by man in Europe, who for 300 years has been selecting the smallest specimens of the litters and then crossing them with each other for generations to get a very small horse.
With the passage of time, and as the European royal courts began to decline, dwarf horses became almost extinct. But they were divided and dispersed throughout the Old Continent.
It descends from the Andalusian horses that the Spanish took to the »New World» to conquer it. Now, since everything did not go as expected, they abandoned the horses.
