What Is Destroy Hiding Places Fortnite Challenge
Players simply need to destroy hiding places. Here, what you must understand is that hiding places do not refer to bushes or behind the trees, rather it refers to the handful of objects players can interact with to completely conceal themselves, these include port-o-potty’s, hay bales, and dumpsters.
