Wordle is being developed by Brooklyn-based software engineer Josh Wardle. He developed the game for himself and his partner only, and the game remained private until October 2021.
In January 2022, Wordle became a worldwide famous game. It especially got popular from the Meta-owned social media platform Facebook.
Wordle asks the players to guess a five-letter word in six or fewer attempts. You are the winner if you are able to guess the right word in the least possible attempts.
If the color turns ‘Green’, it means you have guessed the right word. If it turns yellow, it indicates you have guessed the right letter but the letter is in a different position.
